Commercial licensing. Commercial use requires a separate written
commercial license. A commercial license is also required if either:

1. The application or service has more than 1,000 cumulative users; or
2. The combined gross revenue of the operating entity, its parent
   company, and affiliated entities exceeds RMB 10,000 (~USD 1,428) in any
   calendar month.

Cumulative users include all distinct historical users, whether free
or paid, including users acquired before FacePhys integration.
Inactive users and deleted accounts do not reset the count.

Affiliated entities are entities controlling, controlled by, or under
common control with the operating entity or its parent company.
Revenue includes all business activities, not only FacePhys-related
revenue; intragroup transactions must not be counted twice.


Being below these thresholds does not authorize commercial use or
waive the deployment authorization requirement. Obtain the applicable
written license before commencing or continuing use that requires it.
Submitting an application does not itself grant authorization.

For deployment authorization or commercial licensing, apply at:
https://facephys.com

